// PNM - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

# PNM is the family: PBM, PGM and PPM share one header grammar. This is a
# real PGM header, with "Hello World!" in the comment the format allows.
0000  50 35 0A 23 20 48 65 6C 6C 6F 20 57 6F 72 6C 64 |P5.# Hello World|
0010  21 0A 31 20 31 0A 32 35 35 0A 88                |!.1 1.255..|
